const deepRows=[
 ['The Drowned Margin','bridge','marrowguard:3,ditchling:2','A broken entry bridge crosses the first well. Its walls carry debt marks older than the city.','Find the release plate beyond the narrow bridge.','The plate opens a route to the next well. Someone has scratched the word witness beside it.'],
 ['The Counterweight Stair','steps','warden:2,longbow:2,mistshade:2','A stair folds around a silent counterweight. Its guards still defend a toll that has no living owner.','Use the stair landings to reach the upper controls.','The counterweight moves. The deeper passage answers with a slow mechanical breath.'],
 ['The Empty Cistern','islands','cinderpod:3,inkwitch:2,marshcat:1','Empty storage pools divide the chamber into islands. Heat rises where clean water once stood.','There is a route across the service tiles. Keep the crew within healing range.','The cistern plate records water sent to private gardens during the first famine.'],
 ['The Naming Vault','courtyard','marrowguard:3,medium:2,mistshade:1','Names cover the vault walls in several scripts. Each was entered as a payment instead of a person.','The central record must stay intact. Fight around it and reach the exit seal.','Ilyra copies the names. The vault unlocks when the record is read as testimony.'],
 ['The Unpaid Floor','ridge','duskknight:2,rootward:2,mistshade:2','A deep prison floor held workers whose debts had no stated end. Roots have taken the bars apart.','The ridge gives the casters a long view. Break their line before crossing the cells.','The prison keys still fit. There are no living prisoners here, but the record can free their descendants.'],
 ['The Pale Piles','bridge','dragoon:3,brinedrake:2','Pale foundation piles cross black water. Spear guards leap between them to defend a damaged pressure gate.','Watch the landing marks. Leave room for a safe step when the spears come down.','The piles settle as pressure falls. A narrow crossing opens toward the oldest service road.'],
 ['The Last Towpath','river','bogcolossus:2,mirehydra:2,reedrunner:2','The old underground towpath follows a current that still flows toward the sea. Large beasts nest around its exit.','The current leads out. Follow it without leaving anyone on the far bank.','A mooring stone carries a promise of free passage. The city built a locked gate over it.'],
 ['The Folded Causeway','steps','twinblade:3,longbow:2,wayfarer:1','An angular causeway turns above the deep reservoir. Hidden defenders cover each return in the path.','Take one landing at a time. Every corner that hides them can also shelter us.','The causeway reaches an observation room. Its windows look inward at the engine’s first heart.'],
 ['The Space Between Measures','islands','mirehydra:2,oathfiend:2,arithmetician:2','The ninth well has no level floor. Floating gauges drift between platforms while record creatures patrol the gaps.','Move with the gauge cycle. The highest tile is not always the safest one.','The gauges settle into a single level. Beyond them waits the author of the compulsory bonds.'],
 ['The First Witness','courtyard','oathfiend:1,mirehydra:2','The first witness remains inside a living record at the bottom of the works. It tests whether the crew seeks control or release.','We did not come to own this machine. We came to make its records answerable.','The witness gives up the seal. Index joins the crew and keeps the wells open to anyone who wishes to read.']
];
