// Compact Trials use the full battle system. Two players can share the local crew.
const trialRows=[
 [1,1,1,'The Two Couriers','Windglass','fort','ridge','rescue','broker:1,apothecary:3,recruit:4',8,'m004','Two clinic couriers are caught at a pump house. Keep the route open long enough for both birds to leave.','Protect the couriers; a clear road matters more than a fast pursuit.'],
 [2,1,1,'Night Shift','Fever Fen','marsh','islands','rout','mistshade:3,warden:3,longbow:2,embermage:1,timekeeper:1',15,'m010','A night drill places a tired crew against a field of restless flood bonds. The marsh punishes careless movement.','Stay on dry tiles when a turn ends. Save a recovery action for the next person in trouble.'],
 [3,1,1,'An Unclaimed Chest','Fever Fen','marsh','river','reach','broker:3,pugilist:2,longbow:3,recruit:1',16,'m010','A relief chest has been left between rival salvage crews. Reach it before the dispute blocks the next convoy.','The marked chest is the task. The whole marsh does not need to become a battlefield.'],
 [4,1,1,'King of Reedwater','Alder Wood','forest','courtyard','boss','reedrunner:1,reedrunner:6,marshcat:1,tuskling:2',18,'m014','An unusually large reedrunner leads a flock through the training grounds. The crews must break its charge without losing formation.','The largest bird calls the movement. Watch it while the smaller ones try to divide us.'],
 [5,1,1,'The Dockmaster’s Compass','Ironwake','village','steps','rout','warden:2,broker:3,longbow:3,timekeeper:2',22,'m017','A stolen compass passes between the rooftops of the engine district. A small crew must break a much wider ring of guards.','Take the nearest roof first. Its wall can shelter the people still climbing.'],
 [6,1,1,'Festival of Many Wards','Highlock','cathedral','courtyard','rout','pugilist:2,warden:2,dancer:3,chorister:3',26,'m022','The ward festival stages a contest against singers, dancers, and their guards. Their support effects grow stronger while they perform.','Reach the performers before their rhythms fill the hall.'],
 [7,1,1,'Every Step Marked','Salt Warren','marsh','ridge','rescue','cinderpod:11',30,'m027','A survey medic is stranded beyond a field of unstable cinder growth. Escort them out through the marked safe paths.','A damaged cinder growth is still dangerous. Leave room around anyone sent ahead.'],
 [8,1,1,'The Snow Couriers','Frostledger','snow','steps','rout','twinblade:10',33,'m030','Ten agile couriers use a winter market for a throwing contest. The crew must cross several exposed firing lanes.','One high roof covers two lanes. Claim it before the throwing line spreads out.'],
 [9,1,1,'The Lesson at Stillwater','Stillwater Dock','harbor','bridge','boss','warden:1,warden:5,longbow:2,cantor:2',38,'m035','The open archive recreates Osa’s defense of the workers’ dock. The exercise asks how a better prepared rescue crew might have reached her.','Treat the memory with care. We study the choices, not the value of the people who fell.'],
 [10,1,4,'Four Locks: The Outer Guard','Seal Court','cathedral','courtyard','rout','dragoon:1,relicblade:1,longbow:4,recruit:4',44,'m043','The first of four linked court exercises tests the crew against two commanders and a broad line of recruits.','Break a lane through the guard. Keep enough strength for the next lock.'],
 [10,2,4,'Four Locks: The Voice Chamber','Seal Court','cathedral','islands','rout','embermage:3,cantor:2,tidebinder:3,timekeeper:2',45,'m091','The second court exercise fills the hall with casters and healers. Delayed attacks can cover the routes the crew needs next.','Read the charge order before moving. Stop one voice and make space for the crew.'],
 [10,3,4,'Four Locks: The Long Gallery','Seal Court','cathedral','bridge','rout','wayfarer:1,apothecary:5,broker:4',46,'m092','The third exercise places ten firearm users along an open gallery. Each can support another firing position.','Use the pillars to close the range. Do not spend the whole fight in every gun’s view.'],
 [10,4,4,'Four Locks: The Final Hearing','Seal Court','cathedral','steps','rout','duskknight:2,dragoon:2,warden:3,cantor:2',47,'m093','The final court exercise pits the crews against heavy guards, leap troops, and the two seal marshals.','The healers sustain the wall. Give the front line a reason to turn before you climb.'],
 [11,1,1,'Council of Equals','Lowwater','village','courtyard','rout','recruit:1,wayfarer:1,warden:1,medium:1,timekeeper:1,relicblade:2,geomancer:1,duskknight:1',56,'m054','The Compact’s best volunteers face the crew in a public field exercise. Familiar talents become difficult opposing combinations.','You know what these jobs can do together. Find the link their formation depends on.'],
 [12,1,1,'The Six-Bell Foundry','Lumen Foundry','ruins','steps','rout','dredgeframe:2,dredgeframe:1,dredgeframe:7',64,'m060','Ten foundry sentries begin a final maintenance cycle. The crews have six bell rounds to stop the central command.','The large frames keep the timer. The little ones exist to delay you.'],
 [13,1,1,'A Ledger of Nightmares','Mirror Estate','crypt','courtyard','rout','oathfiend:5,oathfiend:5',67,'m060','The archive recreates five of the engine’s worst bonds at once. Their forces arrive from opposite sides of a divided chamber.','Choose which side needs immediate help. A divided crew still needs a shared plan.'],
 [14,1,10,'Ten Open Records: Arrivals','Lowwater Archive','crypt','bridge','rout','wayfarer:1,relicblade:1,reedrunner:8',69,'m060','The first record tests fast travelers and a flock that can cross gaps the crew cannot.','Watch the fast flanks before they turn a crossing into a trap.'],
 [14,2,10,'Ten Open Records: Tools','Lowwater Archive','crypt','courtyard','rout','wayfarer:1,broker:5,apothecary:4',70,'m098','The second record tests firearm lines, recovery supplies, and the crews that know how to use both.','Attack the supply chain as well as the firing line.'],
 [14,3,10,'Ten Open Records: Apprentices','Lowwater Archive','crypt','ridge','rout','onion:5,inkwitch:1,reedrunner:2,leveehorn:2',71,'m099','The third record places five master apprentices beside dangerous creatures. Simple job names conceal extensive training.','Read their equipment before you judge their rank.'],
 [14,4,10,'Ten Open Records: The First Claim','Lowwater Archive','crypt','islands','rout','oathfiend:2,warden:3,rootward:5',72,'m100','The fourth record combines the first creditor with the witness who made the engine possible. Undead guards stand among hostile growth.','Separate the casters from their cover. Clear one island before taking the next.'],
 [14,5,10,'Ten Open Records: Households','Lowwater Archive','crypt','steps','rout','relicblade:2,duskknight:1,recruit:1,dragoon:6',73,'m101','The fifth record examines the old households and the soldiers who carried out their private orders.','The leap troops need landing space. Deny it while you approach the commanders.'],
 [14,6,10,'Ten Open Records: Care','Lowwater Archive','crypt','courtyard','rout','relicblade:1,warden:1,apothecary:1,cantor:1,medium:2,arithmetician:1,timekeeper:2',74,'m102','The sixth record places the Compact’s protectors on the opposing side. Healing and time effects hold their formation together.','Do not spread damage across a team that can heal it all. Choose a target and finish the task.'],
 [14,7,10,'Ten Open Records: Masks','Lowwater Archive','crypt','bridge','rout','relicblade:1,duskknight:1,twinblade:2,oathfiend:6',75,'m103','The seventh record joins the estate’s masked enforcers with an echo of the forced clinic guard.','Keep recovery close. Their strongest weapon is turning one crew member against the next.'],
 [14,8,10,'Ten Open Records: Consent','Lowwater Archive','crypt','islands','rout','cantor:1,relicblade:2,geomancer:1,mirehydra:6',76,'m104','The eighth record gathers every claimant from Nara’s case with a line of river beasts.','The beasts are dangerous, but the voices behind them decide how long they keep fighting.'],
 [14,9,10,'Ten Open Records: Authority','Lowwater Archive','crypt','steps','rout','dragoon:1,duskknight:3,wayfarer:1,embermage:1,relicblade:1,cantor:1,timekeeper:2',77,'m105','The ninth record assembles the entire Seal Office at the height of its power. Their attacks can break both formations and equipment.','You have met each threat alone. Now choose which one the whole group cannot afford to leave standing.'],
 [14,10,10,'Ten Open Records: The Office Ends','Lowwater Archive','crypt','courtyard','rout','warden:1,cantor:1,duskknight:8',78,'m106','The final record asks what happens if an emergency government refuses to end. Corin’s possible future waits behind eight black-coated guards.','A useful office can still become a prison. Prove that this one can be opened.'],
 [15,1,1,'The Ten Empty Warrants','Powdercut','snow','bridge','rout','duskknight:10',80,'m060','Ten debt soldiers wear the face of the old ration inspector. Each uses a different defense to protect the same empty warrant.','Read the defenses and change the method. The same face does not mean the same opening.']
];
